
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>DBZ vs Marvel vs Capcom</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #10121b;
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header { padding: 24px 12px; }
    h1 { margin-bottom: 10px; }

    main {
      width: min(960px, 96%);
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
    }

    .game {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 8 / 5;
      background: black;
      border: 2px solid #454b63;
      border-radius: 10px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    iframe {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: 0;
    }

    p { color: #c7cbe0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>DBZ vs Marvel vs Capcom</h1>
    <p>Seu cantinho dedicado ao jogo de luta!</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="game">
      <iframe
        src="https://kbhgames.com/game/dbz-vs-marvel-vs-capcom/embed"
        title="DBZ vs Marvel vs Capcom"
        allow="autoplay; fullscreen; gamepad"
        allowfullscreen>
      </iframe>
    </div>
    <p>Projeto independente para fins educacionais.</p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
